senses.gloss:
अह् (only pf. आ॑ह) say, speak, tell (w. dat. or acc. of pers.
& acc. of th.), call, name (2 acc.);
 state, declare to be (acc.);
attribute or adjudge (acc.) to (gen.). —अधि speak or intercede for
(dat.). अनु recite, repeat. अभि speak to (acc.), answer, reply;
tell (dat. of pers. & acc. of th.). निस् speak out, express. प्र
pronounce, deliver;
 say tell, name, declare ( = S.).
